WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.969
A STAGED REFERENDUM
IS UNDERWAY IN FOUR AREAS OF

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:05.572
UKRAINE OCCUPIED BY INVADING
RUSSIAN FORCES.

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:08.975
PEOPLE THERE BEING FORCED TO
VOTE ON WHETHER THE REGIONS

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:13.279
SHOULD BECOME PART OF RUSSIA.
THE ENTIRE PROCESS UNDER THE

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.882
CONTROL OF THE RUSSIAN
GOVERNMENT AND OCCUPYING FORCES.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:20.653
THE U.S., EUROPE, NATO, THE
WORLD, MANY COUNTRIES, SLAM THE

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:24.858
MOVE AS SHAM ELECTIONS.
THIS COMES AS VLADIMIR PUTIN

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:29.929
FACES AN UPRISING FROM HIS OWN
PEOPLE OVER HIS PLANNED

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.098
MOBILIZATION.
AND THE UKRAINIAN PRESIDENT,

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:35.468
VOLODYMYR ZELENSKYY, IS SAYING
THAT HE WANTS RUSSIANS TO REVOLT

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.670
AGAINST THEIR GOVERNMENT.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:42.909
PUTIN'S DRAFT ORDER SPARKING
HUGE ANGRY PROTESTS ACROSS THE

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.978
COUNTRY, LEADING TO MORE THAN
1,300 ARRESTS.

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:47.380
AND NOW SOME RUSSIANS ARE
LEAVING THE COUNTRY ENTIRELY,

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.783
ONE WAY OR ANOTHER.
AS MEN TRY TO ESCAPE THIS WAR.

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:54.787
WE ARE SEEING LONG LINES OF
TRAFFIC BUILDUP AT BORDER

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:56.322
CROSSINGS AND SEVERAL
NEIGHBORING COUNTRIES.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:01:01.528
AS FOR THOSE WHO ARE DECIDING TO
TRY TO FIGHT, THEY ARE SAYING

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.430
GOOD-BYE TO LOVED ONES, AS THEY
LEAVE BEHIND THEIR FAMILIES TO

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.967
BOARD BUSES FOR MILITARY
SERVICE.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:10.570
SO LET'S BEGIN IN UKRAINE.
OUR INTERNATIONAL SECURITY

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:14.174
EDITOR, NICK PATON WALSH JOINS
US FROM KRAMATORSK.

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:17.944
NICK, WHAT CAN YOU TELL US FROM
THE GROUND?

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:23.783
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YEAH, CERTAINLY,
THESE -- I CAN'T EVEN CALL THEM

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:26.920
"VOTES," TO BE HONEST, HANDING
OUT OF BALLOTS APPEARS TO BE

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.555
UNDERWAY.
IMAGES SHOWING THAT IN MULTIPLE

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:30.690
AREAS.
IT'S IMPORTANT TO POINT OUT THAT

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:34.327
THIS IS HAPPENING UNDER WARTIME
CONDITIONS, UNDER THE GUN,

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:37.096
CERTAINLY, AND THAT THESE BALLOT
BOXES ARE BEING TAKEN TO

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:40.266
PEOPLE'S HOMES, ESSENTIALLY, AN
OCCUPYING FORCE GOING TO YOUR

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:43.670
FRONT DOOR AND SAYING, DO YOU
WANT TO VOTE "YES" TO JOIN PART

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:46.506
OF RUSSIA OR NOT?
PRETTY CLEAR WHAT THE OUTCOME

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:48.341
WOULD BE.
AS THEY USED TO SAY IN THE

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.878
SOVIET TIME, IT DOESN'T MATTER
WHO VOTES, IT'S WHO COUNTS THE

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.279
VOTES.
WE DON'T EVEN SEE THAT MANY

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.348
PEOPLE EVEN VOTING HERE.
THERE'S ONLY ONE DAY OVER THE

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:59.018
NEXT FOUR DAYS WHERE IN-PERSON
VOTING AT BALLOT STATIONS SEEM

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:02.455
TO BE EVEN HAPPENING.
BUT THIS FOLLOWS A LONG PATTERN,

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:06.326
FRANKLY, OF HOW RUSSIA FUNCTIONS
IN WHAT IT USED TO CALL MANAGED

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:09.596
DEMOCRACY, MUCH LESS OF A
PRETENSE, FRANKLY HERE.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:13.099
THE CONCERN IS WHAT HAPPENS WHEN
THE RESULTS HAVE BEEN ANNOUNCED.

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:18.304
WESTERN OFFICIALS SAYING THAT
THE TOLL HAS ALREADY BEEN

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.939
DECIDED.
DOES RUSSIA USE THIS MOVE, AND

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:23.776
THE KREMLIN HAS INDICATED THAT
THEY WILL QUITE LIKELY FAST

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:26.012
RECOGNIZE THESE AREAS AS PART OF
RUSSIA.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:29.482
DO THEY ALLOW THAT EXTRA STATUS
AS SOME EXTRA PART OF THEIR

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.952
ARSENAL TO BE BROUGHT INTO PLAY?
DOES IT ENABLE THEM TO DO OTHER

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:36.689
THINGS?
CAN THEY USE RUSSIAN CONSCRIPTS

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:43.730
ON TERRITORY ON WHICH THEY NOW
CONSIDER TO BE PART OF RUSSIA OR

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.699
REACH FURTHER INTO PARTS OF
THEIR ARSENAL.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:49.202
WE ARE HEARING UKRAINIAN
OFFICIALS SAYING, DON'T VOTE,

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:55.041
REPORT BIDS TO TRY TO MAKE YOU
VOTE, AND IN ONE RARE TOWN IN

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:57.844
KHERSON, A PROTEST AGAINST THAT
REFERENDUM, STARTLING BRAVERY.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:00.947
&gt;&gt; NICK, YOU DESCRIBED THE
CALCULUS HERE AND THE CONCERN,

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:04.250
AS U.S. OFFICIALS EXPRESSED THAT
RUSSIA WILL NOW TREAT THESE

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.486
AREAS AS RUSSIAN TERRITORY, AND
THEREFORE MIGHT ESCALATE IN SOME

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:09.622
WAY.
I'M CURIOUS, DOES THIS AFFECT

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.758
UKRAINIAN WAR PLANS?
THE UKRAINIAN MILITARY AGENDA

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:16.462
FROM THE COMMANDERS, THE
OFFICIALS YOU SPEAK TO?

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.831
&gt;&gt; Reporter: AS FAR AS WE CAN
SEE ON THE GROUND, ABSOLUTELY

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:20.300
NOT.
NOT AT ALL.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:24.170
IN FACT, AROUND HERE, THEY ARE
MOVING FORWARD IN CERTAIN AREAS.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.839
YOU SAW VERY HIGHLY MORALE
YESTERDAY.

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:29.775
THERE'S ONE EXCEPTION, WHICH WE
ARE SEEING RUSSIA GETTING SOME

00:03:29.775 --> 00:03:31.477
TRACTION MOVING INTO THAT KEY
CITY.

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:33.613
WITH POTENTIALLY TENS OF
THOUSANDS OF CIVILIANS STILL

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:37.116
INSIDE THERE.
BUT ON THE WHOLE, RUSSIA'S

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:39.585
LOSING ON THE FRONT LINE.
THAT BRINGS INTO QUESTION, JIM,

00:03:39.585 --> 00:03:42.355
EXACTLY THE IMPACT OF THIS,
QUOTE, PARTIAL MOBILIZATION THAT

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:45.425
PUTIN HAS ORDERED.
PROBABLY THE MOST RISKY AND

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:50.863
STRIDENT MOVE OF HIS 22 YEARS,
EFFECTIVELY RUNNING THE RUSSIAN

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.432
GOVERNMENT.
AND, YOU KNOW, THERE ARE MANY

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:57.069
SIGNS OF PROTEST ACROSS THE
COUNTRY, IT'S SO HARD TO TRY AND

00:03:57.069 --> 00:04:00.039
DEFINE HOW CONSISTENT DISSENT
IS, HOW WIDESPREAD IT IS,

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:03.309
BECAUSE OF THE ROLE OF STATE
PROPAGANDA, BLASTING INTO HOMES

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:07.447
THROUGH TV SCREENS, BECAUSE OF
HOW PERVASIVE THE SECURITY

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:09.982
SERVICES ARE IN CRUSHING
DISSENT.

00:04:09.982 --> 00:04:12.218
BUT UKRAINIAN PRESIDENT
VOLODYMYR ZELENSKYY SEIZING UPON

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:15.421
THIS DISSENT TO BASICALLY SAY TO
RUSSIANS, RUN, DESERT, OR LET

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:20.526
YOURSELVES BE TAKEN PRISONER.
HERE'S WHAT HE HAD TO SAY.

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:24.263
ZPLT RUSSIA'S DECISION ON
MOBILIZATION IS A FRANK

00:04:24.263 --> 00:04:27.066
ADMISSION THAT THE REGULAR ARMY,
WHICH HAS BEEN PREPARED FOR

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:33.973
DECADES TO TAKE OVER A FOREIGN
COUNTRY, DID NOT WITHSTAND AND

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:36.409
CRUMBLED.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: SO ESSENTIALLY, WE

00:04:36.409 --> 00:04:40.713
ARE A FEW WEEKS AHEAD HERE,
WHERE RUSSIA HAS TO PUT THESE

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:45.251
TENS OF THOUSANDS OR HUNDREDS OF
THOUSANDS, THEY CLAIM, OF FORCED

00:04:45.251 --> 00:04:47.820
CONSCRIPTS, SOME NOT HAVING THAT
MUCH MILITARY EXPERIENCE, ON TO

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:51.557
A FRONT LINE AND SUPPLY, TRAIN,
AND EQUIP THEM IN A WAY IT

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:55.528
HASN'T REALLY EFFECTIVELY DONE
THROUGH ITS REGULAR ARMY OVER

00:04:55.528 --> 00:04:58.097
THE PAST SIX MONTHS.
THAT'S A STARTLING CHALLENGE

00:04:58.097 --> 00:05:01.000
AHEAD OF THEM, ONE WHICH THEY
PROBABLY WILL NOT SUCCEED.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:05.271
LEADING TO THIS NEXT QUESTION,
DOES PUTIN SUDDENLY FEEL NOW

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:11.644
THAT THE NUCLEAR WEAPONS OR
OTHER PARTS OF HIS ARSENAL THAT

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:14.046
HE STAYED WELL AWAY FROM OVER
THE NEXT SIX MONTHS MIGHT COME

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:16.215
INTO PLAY.
WE'LL HAVE GET THAT ANSWER

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:19.318
SCARILY SOON.
&gt;&gt; NICK PATON WALSH, THANK YOU.

00:05:19.318 --> 00:05:21.554
SO IMPORTANT TO HAVE YOU ON THE
GROUND THERE EXACTLY WHERE THIS

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:23.489
IS HAPPENING.
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR THAT

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:27.193
REPORTING.
LET'S BRING IN MARY LUSHANA.

00:05:27.193 --> 00:05:31.831
NICE TO SEE YOU, MARY.
THANKS FOR GETTING UP EARLY THIS

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.800
MORNING.
TALK TO ME ABOUT THIS

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.536
MOBILIZATION ON RUSSIA.
WHAT ARE YOU HEARING INSIDE THE

00:05:36.536 --> 00:05:38.704
COUNTRY FROM PEOPLE WHO ARE
WORRIED ABOUT THIS?

00:05:38.704 --> 00:05:43.376
AND IS IT, I WONDER, AN
ADMISSION FROM VLADIMIR PUTIN

00:05:43.376 --> 00:05:47.213
THAT THIS IS NOT A LIMITED
MILITARY OPERATION, THIS IS A

00:05:47.213 --> 00:05:53.319
FULL BLOWN WAR?
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING, CHRISTINE.

00:05:53.319 --> 00:05:57.857
IT HAS BEEN SAID IT HAS NOT GONE
AS SMOOTHLY AS HOPED AND ALSO

00:05:57.857 --> 00:06:02.061
HOW THEY PORTRAYED THIS SPECIAL
MILITARY OPERA IGS TO PEOPLE

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:05.031
FROM RUSSIA IN THE PAST SEVEN
MONTHS.

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:09.502
NOW WE ARE FEELING VERY DIRECT
IMPACT OF THAT.

00:06:09.502 --> 00:06:17.510
THEIR LIVES HAVE BEEN UPROOTED
ON THE DAY OF MOBILIZATION, THEY

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.411
ALREADY LEFT FOR TRAINING ON
THURSDAY NIGHT.

00:06:19.411 --> 00:06:21.981
YOU KNOW HOW QUICKLY THAT ALL
UNFOLDED FOR THEM.

00:06:21.981 --> 00:06:25.151
THEY HAVE TO LEAVE THEIR HOMES
AND GO TO TRAINING AND THEN TO

00:06:25.151 --> 00:06:29.121
WAR.
PEOPLE ARE TRYING TO DO WHATEVER

00:06:29.121 --> 00:06:32.258
THEY CAN TO AVOID IT.
SOME PEOPLE ARE FREEING THE

00:06:32.258 --> 00:06:38.898
COUNTRY.
IF YOU HAVE A PASSPORT OR VISA,

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:41.434
YOU'RE LEAVING.
LIKELY TO SEE MORE PROTESTS

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:44.637
TOMORROW.
GENERALLY THERE'S A LOT OF

00:06:44.637 --> 00:06:47.240
PANIC, FEAR AND RESISTANCE.
&gt;&gt; I KNOW SOME OF THE REPORTING

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:51.377
WAS THAT THOSE EARLIER PROTESTS
THIS WEEK, PROTESTERS WERE

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:59.385
BEING, YOU KNOW, DETAINED AND
THEN CONSCRIPTED, PUT INTO THE

00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:04.490
WAR EFFORT.
THE NUMBER WE KNOW IS 300,000

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:06.392
RESERVISTS PUT INTO THE
BATTLEFIELD.

00:07:06.392 --> 00:07:08.895
YOU THINK THERE'S A BIGGER
POSSIBILITY THAN THAT.

00:07:08.895 --> 00:07:11.297
WHY?
&gt;&gt; THERE IS A LOT OF CONCERN

00:07:11.297 --> 00:07:17.470
THAT IS BIGGER THAN THAT BECAUSE
OF HOW MANY PEOPLE ARE BEING

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:21.841
ROUNDED UP, NOT NERVOUS NEW
HAMPSHIRE.

00:07:21.841 --> 00:07:25.378
.
THEY'RE MORE PRONE TO PROTESTS.

00:07:25.378 --> 00:07:30.716
THERE ARE A LOT OF PEOPLE IN
SMALLER REGIONS THAT DON'T GET

00:07:30.716 --> 00:07:33.619
MUCH MEDIA COVERAGE.
SO MANY REPORTS OF PEOPLE

00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:40.626
ROUNDED UP 30, 40 FREEM ONE
SMALL SETTLEMENT.

00:07:40.626 --> 00:07:48.200
THERE'S CONCERN.
RUSSIAN OUTLET?

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:52.638
&gt;&gt; THERE IS A PRESIDENTIAL
DEGREE.

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:54.674
IT COULD BE UP TO 1 MILLION
PEOPLE.

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:57.143
THERE IS NO CONFIRMATION ABOUT
THAT.

00:07:57.143 --> 00:08:01.213
THEY HAVE CITED A SOURCE IN THE
KREMLIN.

00:08:01.213 --> 00:08:06.786
IT'S DEFINITELY BREWING AS VERY
MUCH FULL MOBILIZATION.

00:08:06.786 --> 00:08:09.522
WE KNOW FROM PREVIOUS EXPERIENCE
IN THIS WAR THAT RUSSIAN

00:08:09.522 --> 00:08:12.158
AUTHORITIES WHEN THEY GIVE A
NUMBER, IT QUITE OFTEN IS NOT

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:15.561
TRUE ESPECIALLY WHEN IT COMES TO
THE CASUALTIES THAT RUSSIA

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:17.163
SUSTAINS THROUGHOUT THE
CAMPAIGN.

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:21.767
THEY SAY LESS THAN 6,000 PEOPLE
DIED, 6,000 SOLDIERS, BUT THAT

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:24.170
NUMBER IS LIKELY MUCH, MUCH
HIGHER.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:28.975
&gt;&gt; SOURCES TELLING CNN SORT OF
THIS IS CNN'S REPORTING, MARY,

00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:32.344
THAT RUSSIAN OFFICERS ARE
COMPLAINING ABOUT MOSCOW'S

00:08:32.344 --> 00:08:36.515
DECISION MAKING, INTERVENTION
AND THEY'RE ARGUING AMONG

00:08:36.515 --> 00:08:39.652
THEMSELVES COMPLAINING ABOUT
MOSCOW'S INTERVENTION BUT

00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:43.422
ARGUING ON THE BATTLEFIELD
ITSELF WHAMPT DO YOU MAKE OF

00:08:43.422 --> 00:08:55.601
THAT AND WHAT IT SAYS ABOUT
WHO'S A MONTH, RUSSIA NEVER

00:08:55.601 --> 00:08:59.305
PUBLICLY SAID WHO IS ACTUALLY
THE OPERATIONAL COMMANDER OF

00:08:59.305 --> 00:09:07.880
THIS WHOLE MASSIVE OPERATION.
IT WAS NEVER CLEAR.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:11.217
FROM THE SOLDIERS I SPOKE TO, IT
WAS CLEAR WHEN THEY WENT INTO

00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:14.520
THIS ATTACK, THEY DIDN'T REALLY
UNDERSTAND WHAT WAS GOING ON AND

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:17.590
THAT PERSISTED THROUGHOUT
EVERYTHING THEY DID BECAUSE IT

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:21.627
WAS LAST-MINUTE DUELS DO
SOMETHING.

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:24.930
THERE WAS COMPLETE CHAOS AND
THAT SEEMS TO HAVE CULMINATED IN

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:29.468
THE MASSIVE SETBACK THE ARMY HAS
SUFFERED IN PREVIOUS WEEKS IN

00:09:29.468 --> 00:09:33.839
NORTHEASTERN UKRAINE WHERE THEY
WERE ANNIHILATE THERE BY THE

00:09:33.839 --> 00:09:37.843
COUNTER OFFENSIVE AND HAD TO
LEAVE A LOT OF THE PLACES.

00:09:37.843 --> 00:09:41.514
THIS IS WHY THEY'RE MOVING SO
QUICKLY.

00:09:41.514 --> 00:09:45.384
&gt;&gt; LET'S TALK ABOUT THAT
QUICKLY?

00:09:45.384 --> 00:09:53.125
WHAT IS HE TRYING TO ACHIEVE
SORT OF HIS STAKE IN THOSE

00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:54.193
AREAS.
YES.

00:09:54.193 --> 00:09:59.598
YOU KNOW, IT'S A WHOPPING -- ONE
SIDE HE HAS TO TELL THE RUSSIAN

00:09:59.598 --> 00:10:11.610
PUBLIC HE'S SUNG SEEDING AT
SOMETHING.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:17.083
HE LIBERATED THOSE AREAS AND
HE'S BRINGING THE

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:22.088
RUSSIAN-SPEAKING PEOPLE HOME.
THAT'S WHAT HE LIKES TO SAY.

00:10:22.088 --> 00:10:30.930
ONCE THESE REGIONS ARE FINE.
ANY ATTACK ON THE TERRITORIES

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:34.300
WILL BE CONSIDERED NOT JUST
AREAS IN A DIFFERENT COUNTRY BUT

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:47.046
ATTACK ON RUSSIA AND THAT COULD
PUT US INTO ROUND OF ESCALATION.

00:10:47.046 --> 00:10:50.683
IN IS A STARK AND CONCERNING
ZBLEMT WASHINGTON POST, THANK

00:10:50.683 --> 00:10:54.086
YOU SO MUCH FOR YOUR EXPERTISE
AND YOUR TIME THIS MORNING.

00:10:54.086 --> 00:10:55.087
THANK YOU.

